Carafe: an emulated OpenGL window is presented where its window is on the console's screen, scaled to the size
the emulated mode gives it, and the rest of the screen is black. A scaled picture is drawn as a texture: a
scaled glBlitFramebuffer to the window came out upside down.
LGPL-2.1-or-later, as the file it changes.

